ames </c><00:00:02.729><c>but </c><00:00:02.730><c>hopefully  </c><00:00:02.731><c>these </c><00:00:02.732><c>tips </c><00:00:02.733><c>help </c><00:00:02.734><c>you </c><00:00:02.735><c>out </c><00:00:02.736><c>if </c><00:00:02.737><c>you </c><00:00:02.738><c>have </c><00:00:02.739><c>any  </c><00:00:02.740><c>tips </c><00:00:02.741><c>drop </c><00:00:02.742><c>them </c><00:00:02.743><c>in </c><00:00:02.744><c>the </c><00:00:02.745><c>comments </c><00:00:02.746><c>below </c><00:00:02.747><c>to  </c><00:00:02.748><c>help </c><00:00:02.749><c>out </c><00:00:02.750><c>your </c><00:00:02.751><c>fellow </c><00:00:02.752><c>plumbers </c><00:00:02.753><c>and </c><00:00:02.754><c>if  </c><00:00:02.755><c>you're </c><00:00:02.756><c>confused </c><00:00:02.757><c>as </c><00:00:02.758><c>to </c><00:00:02.759><c>why </c><00:00:02.760><c>there </c><00:00:02.761><c>are  </c><00:00:02.762><c>rabbids </c><00:00:02.763><c>in </c><00:00:02.764><c>the </c><00:00:02.765><c>mario </c><00:00:02.766><c>universe </c><00:00:02.767><c>click </c><00:00:02.768><c>on  </c><00:00:02.769><c>this </c><00:00:02.770><c>video </c><00:00:02.771><c>right </c><00:00:02.772><c>here </c><00:00:02.773><c>for </c><00:00:02.774><c>the </c><00:00:02.775><c>intro  </c><00:00:02.776><c>cutscene </c><00:00:02.777><c>of </c><00:00:02.778><c>mario </c><00:00:02.779><c>plus </c><00:00:02.780><c>rabbids </c><00:00:02.781><c>kingdom  </c><00:00:02.782><c>battle  </c><00:00:02.783><c>thank </c><00:00:02.784><c>you </c><00:00:02.785><c>for </c><00:00:02.786><c>watching</c>

